# apps/kingdom-tactics-server

The Kingdom Tactics multiplayer server (Phase 4). An Express 5 + `ws` Node app that mirrors
`apps/game-server`'s bootstrap (`@shatteredarchive/services-server`: `getConfigFromEnv` +
`createExpressService`, Winston logging, `/health`) and mounts a `/ws/kt` WebSocket gateway
hosting **server-authoritative** matches.

Architecture: all game rules live in `@shatteredarchive/kingdom-tactics-engine`; this app is
transport + match-lifecycle glue. `src/match/MatchSession` owns a `GameEngine`/`MatchState` per
match, authorizes each client action (seat ownership + engine legality), and auto-plays an
`IAiPolicy` (GreedyPolicy) opponent. `src/ws/kt-gateway` mounts the socket, keeps a
`MatchRegistry` (matchId → session + subscribers), validates untrusted frames against the
engine's shared `net/protocol` contract, and broadcasts full-state snapshots (v1: no deltas).
Default port 51000. No auth/reconnect in v1 (Phase 7).
